<%- layout('layouts/boiler') %>

<style>
    .imgPicture {
        height: 450px;
    }
    .footer {
        height: 450px;
    }

    .input {
        border: none;
        background: transparent;
    }
    .butter {
        background-color: lime;
    }
</style>

<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto my-12 p-6">
    <div class="flex justify-center space-x-3 items-center">
        <span class="bg-green-200 text-green-700 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded-full">Popular Articles</span>
        <span class="text-gray-500 text-sm">October 23, 2023</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-semibold mt-6 text-center">Innovative Strategies in <br> Green Energy</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-600 mt-6 text-center">Optimal strategies in green energy involve a comprehensive approach to renewable energy management, selection of appropriate technologies, and implementation of efficient practices.</p>
    
    <img src="http://localhost:1000/img/new2.jpg" alt="Green energy plant" class="w-full imgPicture object-cover mt-6">
    
    <div class="mt-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Achieve Efficient Green Energy Management</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Achieving efficient green energy management involves a series of strategic steps that include selecting technologies that suit environmental conditions, efficient energy management, use of appropriate green energy technology, choosing optimal operation times, as well as effective distribution strategies to increase the efficiency of energy usage.</p>
        
        <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">We have a way to achieve efficient green energy management for engineers and energy actors through a holistic approach, including selecting the right technologies, efficient energy management, application of the latest green energy technology, choosing optimal operation times, and effective distribution strategies.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">1. Selection of the Right Technologies</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Selecting the right technologies is a key step in achieving efficient green energy management. This includes in-depth research into technologies suited to environmental, climate, and operational conditions, as well as selecting high-quality equipment that can provide optimal results. By paying attention to these factors, engineers can increase their chances of achieving efficient green energy management.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">2. Efficient Energy Management</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Efficient energy management is crucial for optimal green energy. This involves implementing strategies to minimize energy waste, optimize energy consumption patterns, and utilize smart grid technologies. By focusing on energy efficiency, organizations can reduce costs, improve sustainability, and enhance overall system performance.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">3. Application of Latest Green Energy Technology</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Staying up-to-date with the latest advancements in green energy technology is essential for achieving efficiency. This includes adopting innovative solutions such as advanced control systems, predictive maintenance tools, and renewable energy integration technologies. Embracing these cutting-edge technologies can lead to significant improvements in energy system reliability and efficiency.</p>
    </div>

</div>

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Related Article</h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <% articles.forEach(article => { %>
            <div class="overflow-hidden">
                <img src="<%= article.image %>" alt="<%= article.title %>" class="w-full h-48 object-cover">
                <div class="mt-4">
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm"><%= article.date %></p>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-2"><%= article.title %></h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-2"><%= article.description %></p>
                </div>
            </div>
        <% }) %>
    </div>

    <div class="text-right mt-6">
        <a href="#" class="text-green-600 font-semibold hover:underline">View all Articles</a>
    </div>
</div>

<div class=" footer relative w-full h-[400px]">
    <img src="https://media.istockphoto.com/id/1414566486/photo/working-at-refinery-oil-production-platform.jpg?b=1&s=612x612&w=0&k=20&c=D-4pc9a8joc3HTQEB84LTAWV87vOhvtUnMUk8FQW__8=" 
        alt="Renewable energy engineers working at night"
        class="object-cover w-full h-full">
    
    <!-- Floating text div -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 flex justify-center flex-col space-y-10 items-center  bg-black bg-opacity-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
       <p class="text-white text-center text-5xl font-semibold">Get involved in the <br> Green energy uprising</p>
       <div class="mt-10 bg-white space-x-3 rounded-full flex flex-row items-center justify-between">
        <input type="text" class="input" placeholder="type your email address">
        <button class="h-full butter w-full bg-lime-600 p-1 px-4 rounded-full font-semibold text-base">Join now <i class="ri-arrow-right-circle-line ml-4 text-xl text-white"></i></button>
       </div>
    </div>
</div>
